<div data-controller="appear">
  <h1 class="type-display-punjabi text-center animate-fade-in-up" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Where to Stay</h1>
  <p class="text-center animate-fade-in-up delay-1" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-12); max-width: 36rem; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
    We have a room block at the JW Marriott Anaheim Resort — the home base for the entire weekend.
  </p>

  <!-- JW Marriott Room Block -->
  <section style="margin-bottom: var(--space-12);">
    <h2 class="type-serif-heading appear" style="font-size: var(--text-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">Our Hotel Block</h2>

    <div class="card appear" style="border: 2px solid var(--color-accent); overflow: hidden;">
      <div class="card-body">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          <div>
            <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: var(--text-lg);">JW Marriott Anaheim Resort</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">1775 S Disneyland Dr, Anaheim, CA 92802</p>
            <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Adjacent to Disneyland · 20 min from Singh Sabha Gurudwara, Buena Park</p>
          </div>
          <span style="background: var(--color-accent); color: white; font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 600; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap;">Group Rate</span>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-4); flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          <span>Pool & Spa</span>
          <span>Multiple Restaurants</span>
          <span>Free WiFi</span>
          <span>Valet & Self-Parking</span>
        </div>

        <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
          We've reserved a room block at a discounted group rate for our guests. We recommend checking in <strong>Wednesday, November 25</strong> and checking out <strong>Sunday, November 29</strong> to be present for the full weekend.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
          Room block availability is limited — book early. The group rate cut-off date will be posted here once confirmed.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          <strong>Tip:</strong> When booking, select <strong>4 guests per room</strong> — this signals to the hotel that you'd like a double queen room, regardless of how many people are actually staying.
        </p>

        <a href="<%= WEDDING[:hotel_block_url] %>" class="btn btn-highlight" style="display: inline-block;" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book Your Room</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Other Nearby Options -->
  <section>
    <h2 class="type-serif-heading appear" style="font-size: var(--text-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">Other Nearby Options</h2>

    <div class="card appear" style="background: var(--color-gold-bg); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-gold); margin-bottom: var(--space-8);">
      <div class="card-body">
        <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          <strong>One thing to keep in mind:</strong> almost all of the weekend's events are at the
          <strong>JW Marriott</strong>, and between our discounted group rate and not having to drive,
          park, or arrange late-night rides between venues, it's both the <strong>most convenient and the
          best value</strong> for the weekend. We really do recommend booking the block above. If you'd still
          like to compare, here are some actual nearby hotels:
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="type-serif-heading appear" style="font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); color: var(--color-text-muted);">Near the JW &amp; Disneyland (Anaheim Resort)</h3>
    <div class="space-y-4" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10);">
      <div class="card appear">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: var(--text-lg);">The Westin Anaheim Resort</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">1030 W Katella Ave · ~10 min from the JW</p>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm);">Modern AAA Four-Diamond resort across from Disney California Adventure, with a rooftop bar, several restaurants, and a large pool. Upscale — similar to or above the JW, so book the block first if budget matters.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card appear appear-delay-1">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: var(--text-lg);">Sheraton Park Hotel at the Anaheim Resort</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">1855 S Harbor Blvd · a few minutes from the JW</p>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm);">Full-service hotel with a resort-style pool, walkable to Disneyland and right in the Anaheim Resort district. Reliable mid-to-upper-range option.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card appear appear-delay-2">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: var(--text-lg);">Hilton Anaheim</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">777 W Convention Way · ~10 min from the JW</p>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm);">Large hotel by the Anaheim Convention Center with multiple restaurants, a pool, and a fitness center. Mid-range with lots of availability — a safe bet if the block fills up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card appear appear-delay-3">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: var(--text-lg);">Harbor Blvd value stays — Best Western Plus Anaheim Inn &amp; Park Vue Inn</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">S Harbor Blvd · walking distance to Disneyland</p>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm);">Budget-friendly motels right across from the Disneyland entrance. Basic but the most affordable way to stay near the venues if you don't need resort amenities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="type-serif-heading appear" style="font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); color: var(--color-text-muted);">Near the Gurudwara (Buena Park)</h3>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="card appear">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: var(--text-lg);">Courtyard by Marriott Anaheim Buena Park</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">7621 Beach Blvd, Buena Park · close to the Gurudwara</p>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm);">Modern mid-range rooms near Knott's Berry Farm — handy if you'd rather be close to the Gurudwara for Friday's Anand Karaj. About 20 minutes from the JW for the other events.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card appear appear-delay-1">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: var(--text-lg);">Knott's Berry Farm Hotel</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">7675 Crescent Ave, Buena Park · next to Knott's</p>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm);">Family-friendly hotel right beside Knott's Berry Farm with on-site dining and a pool. Convenient to Buena Park; about 20 minutes from the JW.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card appear appear-delay-2">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: var(--text-lg);">DoubleTree by Hilton Buena Park</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">7000 Beach Blvd, Buena Park · near Knott's Berry Farm</p>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm);">Full-service hotel with comfortable mid-range rooms and a pool, a short drive from the Gurudwara and Knott's.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card appear appear-delay-3">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="card-title" style="font-size: var(--text-lg);">Buena Park Hotel &amp; Suites</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Buena Park · closest to Knott's &amp; Medieval Times</p>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm);">Value option with family suites — a good pick for larger families who'd like more room and a lower nightly rate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
